NCCL Ring LL instrumentation patch.

Base: NVIDIA NCCL v2.27.5-1
Working tree used for measurement: /root/autodl-tmp/nccl-ringll-prof

This patch adds aggregate thread-cycle counters around NCCL's LL primitive
operations. It is for diagnosis only; `clock64()` and atomics perturb the
kernel.

diff --git a/src/device/ll_prof.h b/src/device/ll_prof.h
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..90cd14f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/device/ll_prof.h
@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@
+/*************************************************************************
